AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant
Intelligent Recipe Recommendation and Nutrition Analysis using NitroStack MCP
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

📖 Overview

AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant is an intelligent MCP (Model Context Protocol) application built using NitroStack that helps users discover recipes, analyze nutritional values, and make healthier food choices through natural language conversations.

The application combines a recipe database with a nutrition dataset and exposes them as MCP tools so AI assistants can answer food-related questions intelligently.

Instead of manually searching through recipes or nutrition tables, users simply ask questions like:

"Show me high protein breakfast recipes."
"How many calories are in boiled eggs?"
"Find vegetarian recipes."
"Show foods rich in fiber."

The AI understands the request, invokes the appropriate MCP tools, retrieves structured information, and returns personalized responses.

🚀 Project Highlights
Built using NitroStack MCP Framework
Natural Language Recipe Search
Nutrition Information Lookup
Category-based Food Search
AI-powered Recipe Recommendations
Fast CSV Dataset Processing
Modular MCP Architecture
TypeScript Backend
React Widget Frontend
Easily Extensible

❗ Problem Statement

Finding healthy recipes and understanding nutritional values often requires switching between multiple websites and nutrition databases.

Users struggle to:

Search recipes efficiently
Compare nutritional values
Find foods based on calories or nutrients
Discover recipes matching dietary preferences
Obtain structured nutrition data quickly

Existing solutions are fragmented and lack conversational AI integration.

💡 Solution

The AI Recipe & Nutrition Assistant solves this by integrating recipe and nutrition datasets into a single AI-powered MCP application.

The system:

Understands natural language queries
Searches recipe datasets
Searches nutrition datasets
Retrieves structured nutritional information
Returns contextual recommendations
Makes food discovery conversational

