🛠 MCP Capabilities

The project exposes intelligent tools through the Model Context Protocol (MCP).

Capabilities
Recipe Discovery
Nutrition Retrieval
Ingredient Search
Food Category Search
Healthy Food Suggestions
Structured Dataset Access
AI Tool Invocation

🔧 MCP Tools
Recipe Module
Tool	Description
search_recipe	Search recipes by name
search_ingredient	Search recipes using one ingredient
search_ingredients	Search recipes using multiple ingredients
get_recipe	Retrieve a recipe by ID
get_all_recipes	List all recipes
random_recipe	Get a random recipe
top_recipes	Retrieve top-rated recipes

Nutrition Module
Tool	Description
nutrition_info	Retrieve nutritional information for a food
search_food	Search food by keyword
get_all_foods	Retrieve all nutrition records
foods_by_category	Retrieve foods belonging to a category

MCP Resources
Recipe Dataset

Contains:

Recipe Name
Ingredients
Instructions
Cuisine
Preparation Time
Cooking Time
Servings
Nutrition Dataset

Contains:

